<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Season’s Greetings &amp; Year-End Updates</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">As we wrap up 2025, we are reflecting on a year of shared impact. Thank you for walking this path with us. Because of your partnership, we have been able to make education more accessible and payments more secure for millions of students globally.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">We have compiled our top highlights and updates from the year in this special edition. We hope you enjoy the read. Wishing you a joyful holiday season and continued success in the year to come.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
