<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-pt-10 mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 29px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 12px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;">Elevating Standards in Recruitment - ICEF &amp; Flywire</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">We’ve partnered with ICEF to champion transparency. Institutions using <strong>Flywire's StudyLink Solution</strong> can now instantly verify agents holding <strong>ICEF Agency Status (IAS)</strong>. This integration streamlines compliance and highlights partners committed to the "<a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.icef.com/raising-professional-standards/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><u>Together for Transparency</u></span></a>" initiative and the highest ethical standards.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
